## 3. Scripting a Topological Graph Enumeration Utility
To scan and identify undocumented or exposed network pathways without throwing massive, noisy payloads at a target website, you can write an optimized script using Python’s networkx library. This script maps out discovered endpoints as graph vectors, calculating whether data flows can bleed through structural perimeter points.

